504 0 obj
<<
/Title (reduced engineering overhead, making it well suited to internal tools, prototypes, and workflow applications. Traditional development trades speed and simplicity for complete control, extensive customization, and long-term scalability, making it the preferred choice for complex, performance-critical, or strategically differentiated systems. Most mature organizations use both approaches selectively rather than treating the choice as all-or-nothing.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 443 0 R
/Prev 503 0 R
>>
